msgstr "**做什么**：变更摘要"

#: ../../changes/index.md:11 9c6eca8fbbce42fbbd8c1483bafd5418
msgid "**Impact**: Affected components and stakeholders"
msgstr "**影响**：受影响的组件与干系人"

